# Base URL of the Express server (server/), no trailing slash.
#
# This is an override, not a requirement. Unset, the client picks for itself:
# http://localhost:3000 in development, https://tubeko.onrender.com in a
# production build. Set it to point a deployment at a different server, and
# allow the client's origin on the server side with ALLOWED_ORIGINS in
# server/.env. Vite only exposes variables prefixed VITE_ to the bundle.
VITE_API_BASE=
